<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 296-4 V BANGLADESH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 296-4 V BANGLADESH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka scored 296-4 against Bangladesh in their Asia Cup match at the Singhalese Sports ground on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The match was reduced from 50 to 46 overs after overnight rain delayed the start.</p>
